---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Account Deletion"
  description="How to delete a LittlePickle authentication account or a shared player profile from the app."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Delete your LittlePickle account in the app</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open LittlePickle and select the <strong>Profile</strong> tab.</li>
      <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong>.</li>
      <li>Select <strong>Delete account</strong>.</li>
      <li>Review the deletion notice and confirm <strong>Delete account</strong>.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      Your authentication account is disabled immediately, the app signs you out, and permanent deletion is
      scheduled for 30 days later. This applies to email-based and automatically created guest accounts. You
      do not need to email support to start the process.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What happens to account data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The authentication account cannot be used to sign in after the request is confirmed.</li>
      <li>
        After 30 days, the Supabase authentication record, private account profile, league memberships, and
        profile images owned by that account are permanently removed.
      </li>
      <li>
        Organization, session, score, and match records may retain an anonymized reference where needed to
        preserve shared league history.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Delete a shared player profile</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open LittlePickle and select the <strong>Profile</strong> tab.</li>
      <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong> and select <strong>Delete profile</strong>.</li>
      <li>Review the deletion notice and confirm <strong>Delete profile</strong>.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      A player profile is a shared league record and is separate from the authentication account. It becomes
      unavailable immediately. During the 30-day recovery period, support or a league administrator can
      restore it. After 30 days, the display name is replaced with “Deleted player,” the profile photo and
      rating-change ledger are removed, and the rating is reset. Anonymized match participation may remain
      so completed league results stay accurate.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Need help?</h2>
    <p>
      Contact <a href="mailto:support@joinlittlepickle.com">support@joinlittlepickle.com</a> with questions
      about an account request or during a player profile’s 30-day recovery period.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
